$ gov --json --session probe-58e7d287 gate present HDG-0001
  -> ok
$ gov --json --session probe-58e7d287 decide HDG-0001 --option C
  -> ERROR [GATE_OPTION_INVALID] 'C' is not an option of HDG-0001; the answer must be one of ["A", "B"]
